{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadioPicker"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a custom radio trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPickerData"},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Forbidden by design","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a read only state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in radio buttons using MISORadioPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the MISORadioItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional withdefault values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISORadioPickerData<String>] {","        [","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                        label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                        extraLabel: \"Very spicy\",","                                        description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                        label: \"IPA beer\",","                                        description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                        label: \"Mineral water\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: String = \"Choice_1\"","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical","    MISORadioPicker(selection: $selection, radios: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horitzontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the radio buttons are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    MISORadioPicker(selection: $selection,","                    radios: someDataToPopulate,","                    isReversed: true,","                    isReadOnly: true,","                    placement: .horitzontal(true))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.14.0"}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoradiopicker"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/init(selection:radios:placement:isOutlined:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"text":"A